sequenceDiagram
    participant U as 👤 User
    participant FE as 📱 Vue.js Dashboard
    participant BE as 🔧 NestJS Backend
    participant S as 💳 Stripe
    participant DB as 🗄️ MongoDB

    Note over U,DB: Subscription Purchase Flow
    U->>FE: Browse subscription plans
    FE->>BE: GET /plans/latest
    BE-->>FE: Return plan details
    FE->>U: Display plan cards with pricing

    U->>FE: Click "Subscribe" on Basic Plan
    FE->>BE: POST /stripe/checkout-session
    BE->>S: Create Checkout Session
    S-->>BE: Return checkout URL
    BE-->>FE: Return checkout URL
    FE->>S: Redirect to Stripe Checkout
    U->>S: Enter payment details
    S->>U: Payment confirmed

    Note over S,DB: Webhook — Automatic Sync
    S->>BE: POST /stripe/webhook (checkout.session.completed)
    BE->>DB: Create subscription record
    BE->>DB: Set quota & usage counters
    S-->>U: Redirect to Success page
    U->>FE: View active subscription & quotas

    Note over U,DB: Subscription Renewal
    S->>BE: POST /stripe/webhook (invoice.paid)
    BE->>DB: Extend end date
    BE->>DB: Reset usage to zero
